_:nae2e3914b71442258ccd6da792e56c12b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateMap> .
_:n620c5d5f81a448269594b8218f2716cbb2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A Target MAY describe the serialization format with\n        rml:serialization to use when exporting RDF triples to a Target.\n        Defaults to N-Quads if unspecified.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Object Map must generate a IRI, Blank Node, or Literal which has optionally\n    a language tag or datatype.\n    " .
_:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b34 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b35 .
