_:n064d1b1692df439489296f63f41c6a16b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:path specifies the file path, relative to rml:root if\n        provided, or absolute otherwise.\n        " .
_:n147ff07219df4627a24c839ba9ca7fe1b1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:referenceFormulation" .
_:Nda28c7fc7e3a4acbba4d26c44e258b36 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:nf12824d393d843e9a1d02a98039bc96fb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n        " .
_:n685b77e055a74923be7f58ab7f00687db8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:n685b77e055a74923be7f58ab7f00687db9 .
_:n620c5d5f81a448269594b8218f2716cbb1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        The target (rml:target) locates the output target. It is a URI\n        that represents the target where it must export generated RDF triples\n        to.\n        " .
_:n685b77e055a74923be7f58ab7f00687db6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTermMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Term Map.\n    " .
