_:n24ca446b35584c0cad491eb53f53bf3eb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:source must be provided as a string Literal.\n        " .
_:nf12824d393d843e9a1d02a98039bc96fb3 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/template> .
_:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b11 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:SubjectMap must be an IRI or blank node.\n        " .
_:nf12824d393d843e9a1d02a98039bc96fb4 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        A property for indicating whether a term map is a constant-valued term \n        map.\n        " .
_:nae2e3914b71442258ccd6da792e56c12b6 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Specifies the predicate for the generated triple from the logical table \n        row or iterator.\n        " .
_:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b32 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b33 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLDatatypeMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:DatatypeMap must specify an rml:template, rml:reference, or rml:constant\n    with the IRI of the datatype.\n    " .
_:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b13 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/predicateObjectMap> .
_:n4fcf87d49c58412ba54d22970cb1bc33b14 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\n        Base IRI to use for generating RDF triples or quads.\n        " .
