_:n064d1b1692df439489296f63f41c6a16b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:root defines the root against which a relative rml:path is\n        resolved: rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory, rml:MappingDirectory, or an\n        absolute path string Literal. Defaults to\n        rml:CurrentWorkingDirectory if not specified.\n        " .
_:na5d370df94d64b4d80e877ed579ca7a6b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:encoding must be provided as an IRI.\n        " .
