_:nae2e3914b71442258ccd6da792e56c12b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:n620c5d5f81a448269594b8218f2716cbb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#maxCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
