<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLTriplesMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Triples Map requires exactly one rml:subject or one rml:subjectMap and zero\n    or more rml:predicateObjectMaps.\n    " .
