<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    Represents a Graph Map.\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalSourceShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical source is any source that is mapped to RDF triples.\n    " .
