_:naa215d3248cf4508b9c9b43efa07e358b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:termType must be either rml:IRI, rml:UnsafeIRI,\n        rml:URI, rml:UnsafeURI, rml:Literal, or rml:BlankNode for a Term Map.\n        May only be provided once.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLGraphMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n209bcf41cd544236ac255740b572c046b1 .
