_:naa215d3248cf4508b9c9b43efa07e358b15 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n            Only one of rml:template, rml:constant, or rml:reference is allowed.\n            " .
_:n685b77e055a74923be7f58ab7f00687db1 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:parent/rml:parentMap may only be provided once and \n        not at the same time.\n        " .
