_:na5d370df94d64b4d80e877ed579ca7a6b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        rml:encoding specifies the encoding to use when accessing the data \n        source. By default, UTF-8 is used.\n        " .
